  "summary_en": "Working paper submitted by ten states to the CCW GGE on LAWS, documenting gender and racial bias in AI and its amplified risks in autonomous weapons. It urges that a future normative framework include positive obligations on bias, including testing, dataset documentation, benchmarking and training.",
