   "Future LAWS framework should include positive obligations on algorithmic bias",
   "Comprehensive testing and review to identify and correct biases",
   "Rigorous documentation of datasets for traceability and transparency",
   "Benchmark models against gender, age and race in scenarios distinct from training data",
   "Training and awareness for those testing and using systems"
